# The book root as a build context (BOOK-187): `site/docker-compose.yml` passes this directory to
# the image build as the `canon` additional context, and an image carries the canon and nothing
# else from it (ADR-043 G3). Everything else here — `.git`, docs, shots, the site tree itself —
# is not canon: it must not be sent to the builder, and it must never end up in an image.
